fun main() { print (2 + 3) * 4; }
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// w07_grouped.mini  (PDF section 8, saved there as grouped.mini)
// parentheses override precedence.
//
// Try:  minic ast w07/w07_grouped.mini ->
//         (print (binary * (group (binary + (number 2) (number 3))) (number 4)))
//       minic run w07/w07_grouped.mini -> 20
//
// Before the edit: "parse: TODO WEEK07: implement addition and subtraction
// parsing", at the + inside the parentheses.
//
// The group is a primary expression, so factor() treats (2 + 3) as one operand
// of *. Compare 2 + 3 * 4 in w07_arithmetic.mini, which gives 14.
